      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Thunderclasts returned at the Siege of Kholinar. At the Battle of Thaylen Field Odium summoned two, Kai-garnis and Yushah. Szeth destroyed Yushah for good with Nightblood, and Renarin immobilised Kai-garnis, who fled her stone body.",
          "revealedIn": [
            {
              "all": [
                { "book": "way-of-kings", "chapter": "60" },
